  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec810658681aef64daf163b006389223, type: 3}
  m_Name: ExhibWoman
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NPCName: Catherine
  lines:
  - Hi there, I'd like to introduce you to our latest product launch, the mahogany
    leather bag! It's stylish, lightweight and comes with lots of storage compartments
    for all your needs.
  - My name is Catherine. I am a virtual staff member of this exhibition hall, alongside
    Peter.
  - My dialogue can be customized and I can be placed anywhere inside this space
    to talk about your company and products. As a virtual staff member, I am around
    24/7 to facilitate an enjoyable experience for every user that visits.
  - Feel free to check out the other products on display, and I hope you enjoy your
    visit.
